msgctxt "64"
msgid "Well, that was quite a match."
msgstr "Beh, è stato un bell'incontro."

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"As a matter of fact, we're offering a little promotion here for couples who "
"play together. Would you care to try it out?"
msgstr ""
"Anzi, abbiamo una cosetta qui per le coppie che giocano insieme. Vi andrebbe"
" di provarla?"

msgctxt "88"
msgid "What kind of promotion?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"It's called Prize Roulette. The names of prizes will be written on the dart "
"board."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "You win whatever your dart hits. Simple, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Your lady friend will have to work extra hard for some of these prizes. What"
" do you say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Sounds fun. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default> Kiryu-san, let's try it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Sounds fun. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default> Kiryu-san, let's try it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "All right. Let's give it a try."
msgstr "Va bene. Proviamoci."

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Very well, sir!"
msgstr "Molto bene, signore."

